   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Autonomous cars on a smart road with digital interface and connectivity features..Scene: Futuristic Transportation Photography Technique: Digital Art and Illustration Camera and Lens: Not applicable as this is a digitally created image Description: This digitally illustrated image portrays a futuristic vision of transportation with autonomous cars traveling on a smart road. The vehicles are highlighted with illuminated outlines and interface elements that display their connectivity and autonomous functions. The road is embedded with digital indicators for traffic management, and the night setting emphasizes the advanced LED lighting and technology integration. This scene imagines the potential advancements in automotive technology, focusing on safety, efficiency, and interconnectivity in a high-tech, sustainable future. --ar 2:1 Job ID: dd3364ca-85e2-4e83-86ef-ce23ff1ff24b</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
